# F26: native decode extension build artifacts. The .so / .pyd / generated .c
# are never committed (a committed .pyd makes the source ZIP download get
# blocked by corporate file-download policy). Instead CI commits a base64 TEXT
# sidecar (oasis_fastdecode.*.pyd.b64) which rides the source ZIP safely; the
# user materializes the real .pyd locally with tools/unpack_fastdecode.py.
build/
*.so
*.pyd
glas/core/oasis_fastdecode.c
